Package: omopReportToolkit
Type: Package
Title: Render-Only Manuscript Report Helpers for OMOP CDM Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Duke Vascular Informatics", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "noreply@duke.edu")
Description: Greyscale-safe manuscript figure styling and generic Word-report
    helpers (bibliography formatting, calibration statistics, ROC/calibration
    figures, a styled Table 1 flextable, docx post-processing) shared across
    OMOP CDM study repos. Consumes only result artifacts already on disk
    (CSVs, person-level score tables) -- never a database connection. Per-study
    report composition (which tables, which figures, clinical narrative) is
    intentionally NOT part of this package; it lives in that study's own
    <study>-report repo (scaffolded from omop-report-template) that calls
    into this one.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.0.0),
    officer,
    flextable,
    patchwork,
    pROC,
    devEMF,
    grid
Suggests:
    ragg,
    testthat (>= 3.1.5)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
